      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We present an unusual case of bilateral aural symptoms in a 34-weeks pregnant woman with Hughes syndrome. This report underscores the unpredictable nature of this syndrome and its ENT complications. No previous case of fluctuating hearing loss and otorrhoea in Hughes syndrome has been described."},
